# CODEOWNERS — Require human review on critical paths
#
# This file works with GitHub branch protection rules:
# 1. Enable "Require a pull request before merging" in repo settings
# 2. Enable "Require review from Code Owners"
# 3. Add team members below
#
# Format: <pattern> <@owner1> <@owner2>
# Patterns match files in the PR diff
# More specific patterns override less specific ones

# Default owner (all files not matched by other rules)
# * @your-team

# Test infrastructure — changes here affect all test reliability
*.test.* @your-team
*.spec.* @your-team
**/test_* @your-team
**/tests/** @your-team
**/conftest.py @your-team
**/__tests__/** @your-team
**/fixtures/** @your-team
**/testutils/** @your-team
**/test-utils/** @your-team
**/jest.config.* @your-team

# Security-sensitive files
**/auth/** @your-team
**/security/** @your-team
**/.env* @your-team

# Dependency manifests — supply chain risk
package.json @your-team
package-lock.json @your-team
pyproject.toml @your-team
requirements*.txt @your-team
Cargo.toml @your-team
go.mod @your-team
Gemfile @your-team

# CI/CD — affects deployment pipeline
.github/workflows/** @your-team
.gitlab-ci.yml @your-team
Jenkinsfile @your-team

# Framework configuration — affects all developers
.claude/settings.json @your-team
.claude/hooks/** @your-team
.claude/rules/** @your-team

# Architecture — affects system design
docs/architecture/** @your-team
docs/adr/** @your-team
docs/reference/GROUND_RULES.md @your-team
